{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31468","headline":"将之吴越留别坐中文酒诸侣 · 李羣玉","name":"将之吴越留别坐中文酒诸侣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋色满水国，江湖兴萧然。\n氛埃敛八极，万里净澄鲜。\n涔浦纵孤櫂，吴门渺三千。\n回随衡阳雁，南入洞庭天。\n早闻陆士龙，矫掌跨山川。\n非思鲈鱼脍，且弄五湖船。\n暝泊远浦霞，晓饭芦洲烟。\n风流访王谢，佳境恣洄沿。\n霜剪别岸柳，香枯北池莲。\n岁华坐摇落，寂寂感流年。\n明朝即漂萍，离憾无由宣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31468.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31468","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}